# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restricted / proprietary inputs (docs/DATA_ACCESS.md): never committed
#   data/raw/            Bayley item text (copyright), dHCP/NDA instruments (controlled access)
#   cogn_id_GA.xlsx      item-level dHCP responses
#   items.csv            parsed item text (also inside the pipeline run directories)
#   combined.dat         individual-level Mplus analysis file
#   fscores_*.dat        individual-level factor scores
#   review workbooks     reproduce the item instructions
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
data/processed/cogn_id_GA.xlsx
data/processed/items.csv
**/items.csv
**/items_combined.csv
**/04_labeling/cluster_*_nearest_items.csv
**/04_labeling/cluster_labels_report.md
psychometrics/combined.dat
psychometrics/**/fscores_*.dat
psychometrics/**/difftest_free.dat
psychometrics/difftest_3factor.dat
psychometrics/**/*.dgm
data/outputs/growth_restriction_per_infant.csv
expert_review/records/*.xlsx
expert_review/records/b4_raw/*.xlsx

